msgid "Financial data (South Africa)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-cases/financial-data-south-africa.md:3
msgid ""
"The Public Affairs Research Institute (PARI) used ODE to restructure "
"messy public financial datasets into a clean, consistent format, making "
"them ready for reliable analysis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-cases/financial-data-south-africa.md:5
msgid ""
"ODE automatically profiled the data, instantly highlighting empty cells, "
"type mismatches, and structural inconsistencies that would take days to "
"find manually. This shifted their role from manual detectives to "
"efficient data supervisors."
msgstr ""

